OL,3,GNEWSAThe ecstasy of buying our first
OL,4,Ahome was short-lived after we found 150
OL,5,Afaults
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was the day Georgina and Charles
OL,8,FBarnes had waited three years for -
OL,9,Fcollecting the keys to their first
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FBut when the brand new property was
OL,13,Finspected just days later by a Welsh
OL,14,Fsnagging company - the final quality
OL,15,Fcheck by independent inspectors - they
OL,16,Fidentified 150 defects, including
OL,17,Fincorrectly installed fire barriers,
OL,18,Fsigns of a previous leak and what they
OL,19,Fcalled "exceptionally poor"
OL,20,Fworkmanship.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
