OL,3,GNEWSAThe ecstasy of buying our first
OL,4,Ahome was short-lived after we found 150
OL,5,Afaults
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwansea-based New Home Quality Control
OL,8,Fwas set up by John Cooper after he
OL,9,Fbecame fed up of being asked to hide
OL,10,Fthings from customers on building
OL,11,Fsites.
OL,13,FIt is the responsibility of developers
OL,14,Fto make sure new-builds meet
OL,15,Fregulations, according to the National
OL,16,FHouse Building Council (NHBC).
